// Monster definitions. See BUILD_GUIDE.md §9.
//
// accuracy vs defense: hit chance = accuracy - defense, clamped to 5..95 %.
// speed: 10 is normal; 12 acts 20% more often, 8 20% less.
// threat: spawn budget cost per creature. group: (min, max) spawned together.
// depth: (min, max) floors where it appears.
// natural: false for creatures that never spawn with a floor (default true).
// corpse: false for creatures that leave no body (the Dreaming, swarms).
// teaches: rites that studying the body teaches, one per study.
// boss: resists Binding and can't be freed by Exorcise.
